        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Last item",
            "id": 96223,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Python nos permite usar <strong>indexação negativa</strong> para recuperar valores do final de um objeto indexável, como uma lista.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"4.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"latest = scores[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(latest)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>latest</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Explained",
            "id": 97110,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indexação negativa significa que recuperamos um elemento do lado direito de uma lista. Usamos o símbolo <code>-</code> para indicar um índice negativo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A indexação negativa recupera um elemento do lado mais à direita de uma lista.</p><p>Usamos o símbolo <code>-</code> para indicar um índice negativo.</p><p>Armazene o <strong>último</strong> usuário em <code>last</code> usando índice negativo e exiba <code>last</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code> seguido de <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Item position",
            "id": 96224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar qualquer valor negativo até e incluindo o comprimento da lista, o que recuperaria o primeiro valor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-</code> seguido de <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar qualquer valor negativo até o comprimento da lista, inclusive, que recupera o primeiro valor.</p><p>A lista tem <code>6</code> avaliações. Use um índice negativo que chegue até a <strong>primeira</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-</code> seguido de <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Modifying list items",
            "id": 96225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também podemos modificar itens da lista na posição dada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-</code> seguido de <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando um índice negativo, substitua o <strong>primeiro</strong> usuário por <code>\"Jill\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-</code> seguido de <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Tuples",
            "id": 96226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuplas também são estruturas de dados ordenadas e os valores podem ser recuperados, mas elas são <strong>imutáveis</strong> e, portanto, não podem ser modificadas.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"info = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Graz&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Austria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Europe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"info[\" /><text value=\"-4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vienna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"TypeError: 'tuple' object does not support item assignment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Out of range error",
            "id": 96227,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Encontraremos um erro se tentarmos recuperar um valor em uma posição fora do intervalo do objeto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-</code> seguido de <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A lista tem apenas <code>3</code> itens. Use um índice negativo antes do início para gerar <code>IndexError: list index out of range</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>-</code> seguido de <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` keyword",
            "id": 96228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A palavra-chave <code>del</code> nos permite deletar objetos ou itens dentro de uma estrutura de dados.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"winners = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sigmund&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Olaf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" winners[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(winners)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['John', 'Helen', 'Sigmund']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>del</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` objects",
            "id": 96230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> pode ser usado para deletar qualquer objeto, incluindo estruturas de dados como dicionários, listas e conjuntos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>letters</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A palavra-chave <code>del</code> exclui uma variável, inclusive uma que contenha lista, dicionário ou conjunto.</p><p>Após excluir, tente exibir a variável para gerar <code>NameError</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;letters&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print</code> seguido de <code>(</code>, <code>letters</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` on dictionary",
            "id": 96231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar <code>del</code> com uma chave dentro de um dicionário para remover pares <code>key:value</code> indesejados do dicionário.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>product</code> seguido de <code>[</code> e finalmente <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar <code>del</code> com uma chave de dicionário para remover um par chave:valor indesejado.</p><p>Use <code>del</code> para remover o par chave:valor <code>\"in_shop\"</code> de <code>product</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'price'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>product</code> seguido de <code>[</code>, <code>'in_shop'</code> e finalmente <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: indexing",
            "id": 96238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais valores de índice podemos usar ao recuperar um item de uma lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Valores positivos ou negativos dentro do intervalo da lista</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python só permite que valores positivos sejam usados</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Valores positivos ou negativos dentro do intervalo da lista.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Itens de lista podem ser recuperados com índices positivos ou negativos dentro do intervalo da lista.</p><p>Uma lista tem quatro itens. Qual plano de indexação recupera um item sem erro?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Use <code>2</code> desde o início ou <code>-2</code> desde o fim</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Use apenas valores positivos porque Python rejeita índices negativos</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Use <code>4</code> porque ele se refere ao quarto item</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Use qualquer valor negativo porque índices negativos não podem ficar fora do intervalo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Use <code>2</code> desde o início ou <code>-2</code> desde o fim.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: indexing",
            "id": 96239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Recupere o primeiro e o último valor da tupla para usar na mensagem.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>user</code> seguido de <code>0</code> e depois <code>user</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Retire o valor <strong>primeiro</strong> e o <strong>último</strong> da tupla para a mensagem.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>user</code> seguido de <code>0</code>, <code>user</code>, <code>-</code> e finalmente <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: list items",
            "id": 96233,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual valor será impresso por este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Sarah.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Índices negativos contam para trás a partir do fim de uma lista, começando com <code>-1</code> para o último item.</p><p>Siga <code>-3</code> no código. Qual membro é exibido?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"members = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hayley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gareth&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(members[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Sarah\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sarah</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayley</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Anna</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Gareth</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Sarah.</p></body></html>"
